{"steam_appid":1374860,"steam_name":"Nocturne","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1374860/2141067291/15a11a01ffce377f9ea5f230862c5d5ff7c15b3d/1780100682/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780101790","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257346407/29125029062f2d1c1ad66822ee9e93c261ca0997/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780101790","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/665549c46c3776784b2cf70d8196872dee13c57b/ss_665549c46c3776784b2cf70d8196872dee13c57b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790105784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/583503e024c9d3b915f1d1d6f3178d9bbf622516/ss_583503e024c9d3b915f1d1d6f3178d9bbf622516.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790105784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/6425939e53fd6264f8e27d1f441b7310446aa4bd/ss_6425939e53fd6264f8e27d1f441b7310446aa4bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790105784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/be3fa06fc5eb6876ea99d6d8c22e1c6a4c4c058c/ss_be3fa06fc5eb6876ea99d6d8c22e1c6a4c4c058c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790105784","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/4a09d58af202f3d432872facde13cbccfc63f152/ss_4a09d58af202f3d432872facde13cbccfc63f152.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790105784"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Classic Story RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone. Only the Digital Afterlife remains, silent for a thousand years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Until now.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/8178bde5fcd81ae5ced87c92fbce4cdf.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/8178bde5fcd81ae5ced87c92fbce4cdf.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/8178bde5fcd81ae5ced87c92fbce4cdf.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <br>Nocturne’s rich narrative will leave you questioning what it means to be alive, while you traverse a beautiful world that’s falling apart around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100,000+ word story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >101 playable tracks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ hour campaign.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythm Combat for all Skill Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturne features an entirely skill based rhythm combat system.<br>With six difficulty options, Nocturne is suitable for beginners and veterans of the rhythm genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a huge variety of enemies and bosses with unique mechanics and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks to land critical hits, but miss too many notes and enemies will attack you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/beb3711fb90c0d2c21ffda3686bf978e.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/beb3711fb90c0d2c21ffda3686bf978e.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/beb3711fb90c0d2c21ffda3686bf978e.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full RPG Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturne features all the traditional RPG systems, from leveling and stats, to items, equipment, shops, cutscenes, bosses, exploration, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b8f78406ce1ba4861241f44cab3f86aa.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b8f78406ce1ba4861241f44cab3f86aa.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/b8f78406ce1ba4861241f44cab3f86aa.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat enemies to unlock them in Arcade Mode, where you can replay any of Nocturne’s 101 original tracks, and go for new highscores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/e0bebf2883cc66c11cbd263159d6a929.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Orchestral Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All boss music was recorded live by the Slovak National Symphony Orchestra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.poster.avif?t=1790105784\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.webm?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374860/extras/998497530eedec8c0e0f50b48e84500d.mp4?t=1790105784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an entirely skill based rhythm combat system with 101 playable tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of unusual characters who'll challenge what it means to be alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and beautiful pixel art world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from six difficulty modes suitable for beginners and veterans of the rhythm genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up from equipment, levels, shops, bosses, exploration, secrets and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an original soundtrack with live orchestral performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your highscores in Arcade mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a giant orange fish.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Pracy Studios"],"publishers":["Pracy Studios"],"release_date":"22 Sep, 2026"}